en.text:
Scoring multiple Direct Hits against a target within 3 seconds of each emits 3 damaging shockwaves from its location at the time of activation. Hit counter persists through stow.

Shockwaves appear 0.25 seconds after scoring enough Hits and have a 1 second delay between each pulse. With Bows, the initial delay is decreased to 0.167 seconds. 

Each shockwave deals up to <pve 90 /> <pvp [20] /> damage in a 6 meter radius. Shockwaves deal 33.33% more damage when activated on <link Miniboss or higher tier [#CombatantClassifications] /> PvE Combatants.

Shockwaves inherit Weapon Damage Buffs, the weapon's passive Kinetic Damage Bonus in PVE (10% on <primary/>Primary, 15% on <special/>Special), and its <link Combatant Damage Scaling [#CombatantScaling] />. They also count as non-direct Hits with the weapon for other interactions.

The perk cannot be retriggered by anyone on a target until 2? seconds after the last shockwave.

Hits required for Activation:
• Submachine Guns: #e${14-#d}
• Auto Rifles: #e${12-#d}
• Pulse Rifles: #e${11-#d}
• Sidearms: #e${8-#d}
• Hand Cannons or Scout Rifles (Rapid-Fire and Precision-Frame): #e${6-#d}
• All other Hand Cannons and Scout Rifles: #e${5-#d}
• Rocket Sidearms: #e${4-#d}
• Bows, Sniper Rifles: #e${3-#d}

